s=\"tl-label\" data-tip=\"Fix the parser · postlude\">Fix the parser</span><span class=\"tl-track\"><span class=\"tl-divider\" style=\"left:37.5%\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-run\" style=\"left:22.917%;width:3.125%\" data-tip=\"Agent running · 09:30–10:15 (45 min)\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-run\" style=\"left:26.736%;width:2.431%\" data-tip=\"Agent running · 10:25–11:00 (35 min)\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-prompt\" style=\"left:22.222%\" data-tip=\"Prompt · 09:20\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-phone\" style=\"left:26.736%\" data-tip=\"Prompt from the phone · 10:25\"></span></span></div><div class=\"tl-row\"><span class=\"tl-label\" data-tip=\"Tidy tests · sp-cli\">Task tool tests</span><span class=\"tl-track\"><span class=\"tl-divider\" style=\"left:37.5%\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-run\" style=\"left:45.833%;width:2.778%\" data-tip=\"Agent running · 15:00–15:40 (40 min)\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-run\" style=\"left:48.958%;width:1.042%\" data-tip=\"Agent running · 15:45–16:00 (15 min)\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-prompt\" style=\"left:45.139%\" data-tip=\"Prompt · 14:50\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-prompt\" style=\"left:48.958%\" data-tip=\"Prompt · 15:45\"></span></span></div><div class=\"tl-row\"><span class=\"tl-label\" data-tip=\"Write docs · sp-cli\">Write docs</span><span class=\"tl-track\"><span class=\"tl-divider\" style=\"left:37.5%\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-run\" style=\"left:47.222%;width:0.694%\" data-tip=\"Agent running · 15:20–15:30 (10 min)\"></span></span></div><p class=\"tl-group\">Threads · Not categorised</p><div class=\"tl-row\"><span class=\"tl-label\" data-tip=\"Night build · nix-config\">Night build</span><span class=\"tl-track\"><span class=\"tl-divider\" style=\"left:37.5%\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-run\" style=\"left:0%;width:2.083%\" data-tip=\"Agent running · 04:00–04:30 (30 min)\"></span></span></div><div class=\"tl-row\"><span class=\"tl-label\" data-tip=\"Watch the deploy · nix-config\">Watch the deploy</span><span class=\"tl-track\"><span class=\"tl-divider\" style=\"left:37.5%\"></span><span class=\"tl-mark tl-run\" style=\"left:95.833%;width:4.167%\" data-tip=\"Agent running · 03:00–04:00 (1 h)\"></span></span></div></div>\n    <ul class=\"legend\"><li><span class=\"swatch tl-screen\"></span>Your screen time</li><li><span class=\"swatch tl-focus\"></span>Focus</li><li><span class=\"swatch tl-run\"></span>Agent running</li><li><span class=\"swatch tl-prompt\"></span>Prompt</li><li><span class=\"swatch tl-phone\"></span>Prompt from the phone</li><li><span class=\"swatch tl-appointment\"></span>Appointment</li><li><span class=\"swatch tl-tick\"></span>Pull request landed</li><li><span class=\"swatch tl-mail\"></span>Mail sent</li></ul><p class=\"meta\">Some computers' activity wasn't fully read, so some screen time may be missing.</p>\n  </section>\n  <section><h2>Tracked in Super Productivity</h2><ul class=\"items\"><li>Write tests <span class=\"meta\">· Work · 50 min</span></li><li>Garden › Dig <span class=\"meta\">· Home · 30 min</span></li><li>Walk <span class=\"meta\">· Home · 20 min</span></li><li>Garden › Plant <span class=\"meta\">· Home · 15 min</span></li><li>Shop <span class=\"meta\">· Home · 5 min</span></li></ul></section>\n\n  <section><h2>The day in parts</h2><ol class=\"arcs\"><li class=\"arc\"><h3><span class=\"no\">1</span><span>The parser</span><span class=\"when\">04:00–13:00</span></h3><p>You had agents fix how the journal reads dates. The fix for the morning page landed at 04:00.</p></li><li class=\"arc\"><h3><span class=\"no\">2</span><span>Tidying tests</span><span class=\"when\">13:00–04:00</span></h3><p>You tidied the tests of the task tool.</p><p>You dropped a second way of reading the task list, because nothing &lt;used&gt; it.</p></li></ol></section>\n\n  <section><h2>The day in figures</h2><dl class=\"facts\"><dt>Output</dt><dd><ul><li>2 pull requests landed in 2 repositories, and 1 closed without merging.</li><li>3 tasks marked done in Super Productivity.</li><li>1 thread settled in T3 Code.</li><li>Agents ran in 5 threads for 3 h 55 min in all; at least one was running for 3 h 45 min.</li></ul></dd><dt>Focus</dt><dd><ul><li>6 h 30 min of your screen time was in T3 Code, and agents ran for 1 h 30 min while you had no screen time.</li><li>1 focus block; the longest was 3 h 20 min on Code, 08:12–11:32.</li></ul></dd><dt>Direction</dt><dd><ul><li>Prompts by area: Code 4.</li><li>1 of 3 tasks due on the day was done by its end.</li></ul></dd><dt>Efficiency</dt><dd><ul><li>From an agent finishing to your next prompt in that thread: a median of 8 min over 2 replies.</li><li>From the first prompt in a thread to the last of its pull requests merging: a median of 1 h 10 min over 1 thread.<details><summary>Show the threads</summary><ul class=\"items\"><li><span class=\"time\">1 h 10 min</span>Tidy tests <span class=\"meta\">· sp-cli, 1 pull request, first prompt 2026-10-29 14:50</span></li></ul></details></li></ul></dd></dl></section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2>Focus and short stretches</h2>\n    <p class=\"meta section-note\">Focus is screen time spent at least 25 minutes on one area, not counting switches away shorter than two minutes. The rest is short stretches.</p>\n    <div class=\"split\" data-metric=\"focusMinutes\" data-view=\"split\"></div>\n    <ul class=\"legend\">\n      <li><span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background: var(--focus)\"></span>Focus <span data-metric=\"focusMinutes\"></span></li>\n      <li><span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background: var(--scattered)\"></span>Short stretches <span data-metric=\"scatteredMinutes\"></span></li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2>Time by category <span class=\"estimate\">estimates</span></h2>\n    <div class=\"bars\" data-metric=\"categories\" data-view=\"bars\"></div>\n    <details>\n      <summary>Show as a table</summary>\n      <table>\n        <thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Category</th><th scope=\"col\">Time</th></tr></thead>\n        <tbody data-metric=\"categories\" data-view=\"table\"></tbody>\n      </table>\n    </details>\n  </section>\n\n  <section>\n    <h2>Sent mail by mailbox</h2>\n    <ul class=\"items\" data-metric=\"sentMails\" data-view=\"list\"></ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section><h2>Appointments</h2><ul class=\"items\"><li><span class=\"time\">All day</span>Holiday</li><li><span class=\"time\">10:00–11:00</span>Standup</li><li><span class=\"time\">10:30–11:30</span>Review</li><li><span class=\"time\">12:00–13:00</span>Lunch</li><li><span class=\"time\">03:30–05:00</span>Night train</li></ul></section>\n  <section><details class=\"prs\"><summary><h2>Pull requests landed</h2><span class=\"meta\">postlude 1 · sp-cli 1</span></summary><h3>postlude <span class=\"meta\">· 1</span></h3><ul class=\"items\"><li><span class=\"time\">04:00</span>Start of day <span class=\"meta\">· #12</span></li></ul><h3>sp-cli <span class=\"meta\">· 1</span></h3><ul class=\"items\"><li><span class=\"time\">16:00</span>Afternoon <span class=\"meta\">· #7</span></li></ul></details></section>\n  <section><h2>Threads open for several days</h2><ul class=\"items\"><li>Settled later <span class=\"meta\">· nix-config, since 2026-10-20</span></li><li>Long open <span class=\"meta\">· dev, since 2026-10-25</span></li></ul></section>\n\n  <section><p class=\"meta\">Kontor's bank status was not available.</p></section>\n\n  <section data-sources hidden>\n    <h2>Sources</h2>\n    <ul class=\"items\" data-metric=\"coverage\" data-view=\"list\"></ul>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<div class=\"tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\" hidden></div>\n<script>\n  const METRICS_VERSION = 7;\n  const clock = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(\"en-GB\", { timeZone: \"Europe/Berlin\", hour: \"2-digit\", minute: \"2-digit\", hourCycle: \"h23\" });\n  const longDate = new Intl.DateTimeFormat(\"en-GB\", { timeZone: \"UTC\", weekday: \"long\", day: \"numeric\", month: \"long\", year: \"numeric\" });\n  const sourceNames = { activity: \"Screen activity\", sp: \"Super Productivity\", github: \"GitHub\", mail: \"Mail\", calendar: \"Calendar\" };\n  const statusNames = { partial: \"partly available\", missing: \"not available\" };\n\n  const minutesText = (minutes) => {\n    const whole = Math.round(minutes);\n    const hours = Math.floor(whole / 60);\n    const rest = whole % 60;\n    if (hours === 0) return `${rest} min`;\n    return rest === 0 ? `${hours} h` : `${hours} h ${rest} min`;\n  };\n  const isNumber = (value) => typeof value === \"number\" && Number.isFinite(value);\n  const element = (tag, className, text) => {\n    const node = document.createElement(tag);\n    if (className) node.className = className;\n    if (text !== undefined) node.textContent = text;\n    return node;\n  };\n  const showUnmeasured = (node) => node.replaceChildren(element(\"span\", \"unmeasured\", \"Not measured\"));\n  const show = (node, text) => {\n    if (text === null) showUnmeasured(node);\n    else node.textContent = text;\n  };\n  const each = (key, view, fill) => {\n    const selector = view ? `[data-metric=\"${key}\"][data-view=\"${view}\"]` : `[data-metric=\"${key}\"]:not([data-view])`;\n    for (const node of document.querySelectorAll(selector)) fill(node);\n  };\n  const tip = (node, text) => {\n    node.dataset.tip = text;\n    node.tabIndex = 0;\n    node.setAttribute(\"aria-label\", text);\n  };\n\n  const fillMinutes = (metrics, key) =>\n    each(key, null, (node) => show(node, isNumber(metrics[key]) ? minutesText(metrics[key]) : null));\n  const fillClock = (metrics, key) =>\n    each(key, null, (node) => {\n      const ms = typeof metrics[key] === \"string\" ? Date.parse(metrics[key]) : Number.NaN;\n      node.textContent = Number.isNaN(ms) ? \"–\" : clock.format(ms);\n    });\n  const fillCount = (metrics, key) =>\n    each(key, null, (node) => show(node, isNumber(metrics[key]) ? String(metrics[key]) : null));\n\n  const fillSplit = (metrics) =>\n    each(\"focusMinutes\", \"split\", (node) => {\n      node.replaceChildren();\n      const { focusMinutes: focus, scatteredMinutes: scattered } = metrics;\n      if (!isNumber(focus) || !isNumber(scattered) || focus + scattered === 0) {\n        node.append(element(\"p\", \"empty\", isNumber(focus) && isNumber(scattered) ? \"No screen time.\" : \"Not measured.\"));\n        return;\n      }\n      const total = focus + scattered;\n      for (const [label, minutes, color] of [[\"Focus\", focus, \"var(--focus)\"], [\"Short stretches\", scattered, \"var(--scattered)\"]]) {\n        if (minutes === 0) continue;\n        const segment = element(\"div\");\n        segment.style.flex = `${minutes} 0 0`;\n        segment.style.background = color;\n        tip(segment, `${label}: ${minutesText(minutes)}, ${Math.round((minutes / total) * 100)}% of screen time`);\n        node.append(segment);\n      }\n    });\n\n  const fillCategories = (metrics) => {\n    const categories = Array.isArray(metrics.categories) ? metrics.categories.filter((category) => isNumber(category.minutes)) : [];\n    const largest = Math.max(0, ...categories.map((category) => category.minutes));\n    each(\"categories\", \"bars\", (node) => {\n      node.replaceChildren();\n      if (categories.length === 0) {\n        node.append(element(\"p\", \"empty\", \"No categories measured.\"));\n        return;\n      }\n      for (const category of categories) {\n        const track = element(\"div\", \"bar-track\");\n        const bar = element(\"div\", \"bar\");\n        bar.style.width = `${largest === 0 ? 0 : (category.minutes / largest) * 100}%`;\n        const share = isNumber(metrics.activeMinutes) && metrics.activeMinutes > 0 ? `, ${Math.round((category.minutes / metrics.activeMinutes) * 100)}% of screen time` : \"\";\n        tip(bar, `${category.label}: ${minutesText(category.minutes)}${share} (estimate)`);\n        track.append(bar);\n        node.append(element(\"div\", \"bar-label\", category.label), track, element(\"div\", \"bar-value\", minutesText(category.minutes)));\n      }\n    });\n    each(\"categories\", \"table\", (node) =>\n      node.replaceChildren(\n        ...categories.map((category) => {\n          const label = element(\"th\", \"\", category.label);\n          label.scope = \"row\";\n          const row = element(\"tr\");\n          row.append(label, element(\"td\", \"number\", minutesText(category.minutes)));\n          return row;\n        }),\n      ),\n    );\n  };\n\n  const fillSentMails = (metrics) => {\n    const mailboxes = Array.isArray(metrics.sentMails) ? metrics.sentMails : [];\n    const counted = mailboxes.filter((mailbox) => isNumber(mailbox.count));\n    each(\"sentMails\", \"total\", (node) =>\n      show(node, counted.length === 0 ? null : String(counted.reduce((sum, mailbox) => sum + mailbox.count, 0))),\n    );\n    each(\"sentMails\", \"note\", (node) => {\n      node.textContent = counted.length < mailboxes.length ? \"Without the mailboxes that weren't measured\" : \"Across all mailboxes\";\n    });\n    each(\"sentMails\", \"list\", (node) => {\n      const shown = mailboxes.filter((mailbox) => !isNumber(mailbox.count) || mailbox.count > 0);\n      if (shown.length === 0) {\n        node.replaceChildren(element(\"li\", \"meta\", mailboxes.length === 0 ? \"Not measured.\" : \"No mail sent.\"));\n        return;\n      }\n      node.replaceChildren(\n        ...shown.map((mailbox) => {\n          const item = element(\"li\", \"\", `${mailbox.mailbox}: `);\n          item.append(isNumber(mailbox.count) ? String(mailbox.count) : element(\"span\", \"unmeasured\", \"Not measured\"));\n          return item;\n        }),\n      );\n    });\n  };\n\n  // The section shows only when a source was partly or not available.\n  const fillCoverage = (metrics) =>\n    each(\"coverage\", \"list\", (node) => {\n      const gaps = (Array.isArray(metrics.coverage) ? metrics.coverage : []).filter((entry) => entry.status !== \"complete\");\n      node.closest(\"[data-sources]\").hidden = gaps.length === 0;\n      node.replaceChildren(\n        ...gaps.map((entry) => {\n          const [kind, ...rest] = String(entry.source).split(\":\");\n          const detail = rest.join(\":\");\n          const name = `${sourceNames[kind] ?? kind}${detail ? ` (${detail})` : \"\"}`;\n          return element(\"li\", \"\", `${name}: ${statusNames[entry.status] ?? entry.status}`);\n        }),\n      );\n    });\n\n  const fill = (metricsVersion, metrics) => {\n    const notice = document.querySelector(\"[data-version-notice]\");\n    const version = metrics.metricsVersion ?? metricsVersion;\n    notice.hidden = version === METRICS_VERSION;\n    notice.textContent = \"These numbers come from a different metrics version than this report was built for, so some may be missing. Running /wrap again for this day rebuilds it.\";\n    each(\"day\", null, (node) => {\n      const ms = Date.parse(`${metrics.day}T12:00:00Z`);\n      if (!Number.isNaN(ms)) node.textContent = longDate.format(ms);\n    });\n    for (const key of [\"activeMinutes\", \"focusMinutes\", \"scatteredMinutes\", \"offComputerMinutes\", \"appointmentMinutes\", \"appointmentOffScreenMinutes\"]) fillMinutes(metrics, key);\n    for (const key of [\"firstActivityAt\", \"lastActivityAt\"]) fillClock(metrics, key);\n    fillCount(metrics, \"landedPrs\");\n    fillSplit(metrics);\n    fillCategories(metrics);\n    fillSentMails(metrics);\n    fillCoverage(metrics);\n  };\n\n  const postHeight = () => {\n    window.parent.postMessage({ type: \"postlude:report-height\", height: Math.ceil(document.body.getBoundingClientRect().height) }, \"*\");\n  };\n\n  window.addEventListener(\"message\", (event) => {\n    if (event.source !== window.parent) return;\n    const data = event.data;\n    if (typeof data !== \"object\" || data === null || data.type !== \"postlude:day-metrics\") return;\n    if (typeof data.dayMetrics !== \"object\" || data.dayMetrics === null) return;\n    document.documentElement.dataset.theme = data.theme === \"dark\" ? \"dark\" : \"light\";\n    fill(data.metricsVersion, data.dayMetrics);\n    postHeight();\n  });\n\n  const tooltip = document.querySelector(\".tooltip\");\n  const place = (target, x, y) => {\n    tooltip.textContent = target.dataset.tip;\n    tooltip.hidden = false;\n    const width = tooltip.offsetWidth;\n    tooltip.style.left = `${Math.max(4, Math.min(x + 12, window.innerWidth - width - 4))}px`;\n    tooltip.style.top = `${Math.max(4, y - 34)}px`;\n  };\n  document.addEventListener(\"pointermove\", (event) => {\n    const target = event.target instanceof Element ? event.target.closest(\"[data-tip]\") : null;\n    if (target) place(target, event.clientX, event.clientY);\n    else tooltip.hidden = true;\n  });\n  document.addEventListener(\"focusin\", (event) => {\n    const target = event.target instanceof Element ? event.target.closest(\"[data-tip]\") : null;\n    if (!target) return;\n    const box = target.getBoundingClientRect();\n    place(target, box.left, box.top);\n  });\n  const hideTooltip = () => {\n    tooltip.hidden = true;\n  };\n  document.addEventListener(\"focusout\", hideTooltip);\n  document.addEventListener(\"pointerleave\", hideTooltip);\n\n  new ResizeObserver(postHeight).observe(document.body);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
}
